// The Delve's regions (spec 14.1), top to bottom: four levels each, the boss on the fourth, a Waystone after it.
// A Delve of 12 levels or more ends in the region marked "final". "families" says who lives there;
// "wanderers" scales the chance of a wandering monster during a rest; "forgeOneIn" puts a forge in one level in N.
// "hush": noise wakes the dead along the passages. "candles": lit candles in each level (they show you to things;
// Use snuffs one). "shelves": the share of room walls lined with bookshelves (Use searches one for a book).
// "pods": spore pods in each level (they burst near anything; fire ignites the cloud). "roots": tangles choking the
// corridors (Use cuts one; fire burns it). "rootWalls": the share of room walls overgrown with roots (the look only).
// "shards": the share of floor cells strewn with broken glass (it crunches and cuts, once). "rifts": tears in each
// level that let the Unmade through (Use seals one). "mirrorWalls": the share of room walls of black glass (the look).
// "packMax": the most creatures in a pack (2 to this; 4 unless set).
